The test modifies the global capabilities of the context using `SetCapabilities(mock_capabilities)`. Since the context is typically shared across multiple tests in the suite to avoid overhead, not restoring the original capabilities can pollute subsequent tests and lead to flakiness or unexpected failures. Please restore the original capabilities at the end of the test.

```suggestion
  EXPECT_RECT_NEAR(result_coverage.value(), Rect::RoundOut(coverage.value()));
  ASSERT_TRUE(SetCapabilities(old_capabilities).ok());
}
```

